WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Early warning and division of labor are effective

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,600
But we have no actual cooperation

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,920
As soon as the enemy changes position

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,360
The defense line at the main entrance is in chaos.

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,680
My shield is too big

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,460
Intensity drops too quickly

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,420
I can only focus one arrow at a time

8
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,900
I can't take care of people coming from the front and side at the same time.

9
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,660
My increase can only fall on one target.

10
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:19,500
There will definitely be vacancies when people are replaced.

11
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,230
I'm back this time

12
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:23,870
Next time I might be asleep

13
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:26,710
Maybe even further away

14
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,350
Now there are already people who want to defect

15
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:30,670
Can we continue to accept people?

16
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,670
But the ability to register is required

17
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,870
post and intermediate level

18
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,470
The increase in the number of people cannot replace physical training

19
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:36,030
Screening for suitable people

20
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:37,230
While training existing members
